<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Paul Y-ITC warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Paul Y-ITC warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International Ltd said it issued 80 million American-style call warrants on shares of Paul Y-ITC Construction Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$1.995     PREMIUM	 13.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.22	GEARING	 8.9X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  28.APR.97    PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  2,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$1.95</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS U.K.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
